        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Read about our progress in  $ \\underline{\\text{By the Numbers}} $. Learn more about the methodologies that we use to calculate progress toward each of our goals and key drivers in the  $ \\underline{\\text{Appendix}} $.",
